{
    "background_story": "Emilia had always felt a sense of restlessness, as if she was meant to be somewhere else. Growing up in a small village, she spent most of her days gazing out at the horizon, dreaming of far-off lands and exotic cultures. After saving up enough money, Emilia finally embarked on a journey to find her somewhere. She traveled to distant continents, immersing herself in new languages, customs, and ways of life. From the vibrant streets of Tokyo to the ancient ruins of Rome, Emilia felt an insatiable hunger to explore and discover. And then, one day, she stumbled upon a quaint little bookstore in a charming Parisian neighborhood. It was as if she had finally found her somewhere \u2013 a place where she could settle, surrounded by stories and ideas that sparked her imagination. Emilia knew she had found her home, and her sense of wanderlust slowly gave way to a sense of belonging.",
